<title>SPAIN: Spain's Gas Natural interim dividend rises 32 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Gas Natural interim dividend rises 32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Gas Natural said on Monday it would pay a gross interim dividend of 125 pesetas per share against 1996, effective January 8.</p>
<p>&quot;This represents a 32 percent increase compared with last year's 95 peseta interim dividend,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shareholders will receive a net payment of 93.75 pesetas, it added.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
